      "writtenOn": "2017-06-30T14:47:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not for release 1.0 but at some future release would we not be better off using a uuid for each core? My thoughts are that if multiple voltha clusters are running in a CO it would be good to ensure that they are fully differentiated.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
